:: Start
You are standing at a crossroads in a dark forest. The path splits in two directions.

[[Go left|Left Path]]
[[Go right|Right Path]]

:: Left Path
You follow the left path and discover a glowing chest hidden among the roots of an ancient tree.

[[Open the chest|Treasure]]
[[Leave it alone|Start]]

:: Right Path
You take the right path and encounter a friendly traveler who offers you a map.

[[Accept the map|Map]]
[[Decline politely|Start]]

:: Treasure
Inside the chest, you find a magical amulet! You have won!

THE END

:: Map
The traveler hands you a detailed map. It shows a shortcut back to the village.

You have found a safe way home!

THE END